{"repositoryId":1020077878,"availability":"available","full":"whiteSHADOW1234/GitHub-Portfolio","name":"GitHub-Portfolio","description":"Next.js GitHub portfolio with search, tags & auto-deploy—easy to tweak.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2025-07-15T09:58:29Z","updated":"2025-07-23T15:42:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://whiteshadow1234.github.io/GitHub-Portfolio/","topics":["github-actions","github-api","github-pages","portfolio","portfolio-page","portfolio-site","portfolio-website"],"demo":"https://whiteshadow1234.github.io/GitHub-Portfolio/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:12.611Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:12.611Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:12.611Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T00:56:12.611Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GitHub‑Portfolio is a static Next.js site that automatically pulls in your public GitHub repos and showcases them—alongside a personalized intro—via interactive, clickable tags like security, software, hardware, and machine-learning. Unlike typical portfolio templates, it combines hands-free GitHub automation, developer-defined topical interests, and dynamic filtering to create a personalized, always-updated showcase. Just fork, customize your tags and intro, and deploy instantly with GitHub Pages—all without a backend.","This project is intentionally simple and beginner-friendly. Feel free to tweak the UI, refactor components, change layout behavior, or even replace the entire filtering logic—this is just a basic starter to get you up and running quickly. Your creativity is welcome!"],"features":["Automated Updates: Fetches repository data every 6 hours","Self‑Intro Section: Brief developer introduction with following tag section","Tag Filters: Filter projects by self-defined tags like security, software, hardware, machine‑learning","Search & Filter: Find rep